  "title": "Snackasnicker Pie",
  "description": "Simply add chopped, chocolate candy bars to a cream cheese filling, and pour it over a layer of more chopped candy bars in the bottom of a graham cracker crust. Then bake it so that all the luscious candy melts and mingles with the lovely cream cheese filling.",
  "authors": [
